Part A: closed-form fixed point and residual of the map
base alpha 10 beta 2 varsigma 1/2 delta 3/4
fixed_point c0 4 c1 -3/10
residual_c0 0 residual_c1 0
Part B: iteration at the base parameters from (0, 0)
base fixed_point c0 4 c1 -3/10
base c0_path ['0', '5', '15/4', '65/16', '255/64', '1025/256', '4095/1024', '16385/4096', '65535/16384']
base c1_path ['0', '-3/8', '-9/32', '-39/128', '-153/512', '-615/2048', '-2457/8192', '-9831/32768', '-39321/131072']
base c0_error_ratios ['-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4']
base c1_error_ratios ['-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4', '-1/4']
Part C: varsigma equal to beta, the iteration does not converge
equal fixed_point c0 5/2 c1 -3/16
equal c0_path ['0', '5', '0', '5', '0', '5', '0']
equal c1_path ['0', '-3/8', '0', '-3/8', '0', '-3/8', '0']
equal c0_error_ratios ['-1', '-1', '-1', '-1', '-1', '-1']
equal c1_error_ratios ['-1', '-1', '-1', '-1', '-1', '-1']
Part D: varsigma above beta, the error grows
large fixed_point c0 2 c1 -3/20
large c0_path ['0', '5', '-5/2', '35/4', '-65/8', '275/16', '-665/32']
large c1_path ['0', '-3/8', '3/16', '-21/32', '39/64', '-165/128', '399/256']
large c0_error_ratios ['-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2']
large c1_error_ratios ['-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2', '-3/2']
Part E: damped step with weight beta / (beta + varsigma) at the base parameters
weight 4/5 damped_step c0 4 c1 -3/10 equals_fixed_point True
Part F: fixed-point identity on the five-point grid of z, exact
z_grid ['-2', '-1', '0', '1', '2'] identity_holds [True, True, True, True, True]
rc=0
